# The detail path with video.draw_distance = max (docs/port/DETAIL.md 6): every part of the world, SYN_FAR 6,000 ft
# out through a matrix divided by four, the far scenery at its place 21,000 ft out, no level of detail's limit.
# until: 0x400000:60
# seconds: 90
# expect: state=0x00400000: players 1, windows 1, cars 6, mode 0, track 0
# args: --set video.draw_distance=max --screenshot-at 1000 --screenshot detail_max.png
# check: tools/port/detail_check.py detail_max.log --level max --world 6 --all-parts --lod-cut 0 --range 0
5 A            # the controller pak warning (0x40000000)
8 START        # the start prompt (4)
11 A           # the main menu (0x10): the race
14 A           # the player screen (0x20)
17 A           # the mode screen (0x40): a single race
20 A           # the track select (0x80): track 0
23 A           # the car select (0x100); then the race start, PrePlay, the countdown, the race
